  "_": "Single source of truth for sections: title, blurb (shown in the Showcase), viewer group and order of items; section 00 holds only items that are not shown in the Showcase, so the Showcase numbers run 01…; `default: true` marks the group the Library opens on. Edit here, then run: node docs/sync-sections.mjs (from the project root). It rewrites the @ds-bundle header of components/bundle.js (order in the design-system page), the group= marker of every preview, and showcase/cards.json (order in the Showcase app). Card captions (name, subtitle, viewport) live in showcase/cards.json and are carried over. An item is a component/card folder name; {\"name\",\"card\"} is a Showcase-only card (file under showcase/cards/), {\"name\",\"showcase\":false} is shown only in the design-system page.",
